robot_docs_command() {
    cat <<'GUIDE'
Agent Flywheel operator guide

1. Install or converge the eight-module PARTIAL_SAFE environment:
   flywheel mac install
2. Start the isolated Ubuntu VM:
   flywheel start
3. Read the complete machine status:
   flywheel status --json
4. Attach repository evidence without changing the repository:
   flywheel status --json --rollout-receipt FILE
5. Run the strict installed-module doctor:
   flywheel doctor --json
6. Stop the VM cleanly:
   flywheel stop
7. Inspect one repository before proposing an onboarding PR:
   flywheel repository inspect PATH --json
